    "sourceNote": "贴骨机（拉链粘合机器）和拉链挤出机\n1. 贴骨机（拉链粘合机器）\n MD-900全自动夹链贴膜制袋机 \n Full Automatic Clip-chain Film Pasting Bag-making Machine \n 特点和使用范围\n Characteristics and Scope \n 该机由折边、折底、热合、点断、打孔、焊烫点、热切等功能，可制作各种不同型号的夹链封口袋，如内热合外加点断、外热合袋口加锁头等。\n MD-900Full Automatic Clip-chain Film Pasting Bag making Machine Unit, which was revised, trail-produced, verified and remoulded by referring to advanced foreign technology by our plant, is a multi-purpose bagging machine.This machine has following functio \n 本机采用先进电脑控制、液晶显示及全自动伺服马达驱动，可断夹链、断薄膜、自动报警、无料自动停机、印刷电眼失效自动停、温度不够自动停车、折边采用光电纠编、磁粉张力等功能。\n This machine has adopted advanced computer-controlled, liquid crystal display and automatic service motor-driven. It can cut clip-chain and film, automatically alarm, shut down automatically when no material, stop printing automatically when electronic ey \n 1.本机操作简便、封口牢固、品质美观。\n 1. This machine operates easily, seals firmly and has quality appearance. \n 2.制作过程从单膜原料到电眼纠边、折边、插底、穿拉链、贴合、烫边、割边、超声波、超声波、印刷机电眼、打孔、热切、自动计数、全部过程采用全自动作业。\n 2. The whole procedure is operated automatically from single film raw material to electronic eyes correcting,edge folding, end folding,zipper fitting,pasting,edge welding,edge cutting,ultrashort wave,electronic eyes printing,drilling,heat cutting,and aut \n 主要技术参数\n Main technical parameters\n 型 号\n Model\n MD-900\n 适用原料\n Raw material\n OPP PELDPE等高低压料High and low voitage material \n 电 热\n Heater\n 3KW\n 制袋 宽度\n Bag making width\n <=850\n 制袋 长度\n Bag making length\n <=750\n 制袋 速度\n Bag making speed\n 40-80只/分（one/min）,8-16米/分（m/min）\n 制薄膜厚度\n Film thickness\n 0.03mm-0.09mm(单层single layer)\n 电 源\n Voltage\n 220V\n 整机功率\n Power\n 6kw\n 整机外型尺寸\n Dimension (L W H)\n 9000 1800 2000mm\n 制袋机外型尺寸（长 宽 高）\n Outside Dimension (L W H)\n 4300 1600 1800mm\n 热贴合机外型尺寸（长 宽 高）\n Hot Pasting Machine Dimension (L W H) \n 1700 1850 2000mm\n 折边机外型尺士（长 宽 高）\n Ed",
